T*
() Tj
T*
(2 tbsp butter) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1 medium yellow onion, diced) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3 garlic cloves, minced) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1 can \(28 oz\) whole peeled tomatoes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2 cups chicken or vegetable broth) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
