(Melt butter in a small light-colored pan over medium heat. It foams, the foam settles,) Tj
T*
(and golden-brown specks appear with a nutty smell \(3 to 5 minutes\). Pour it immediately) Tj
T*
(into a bowl so it stops cooking. Spoon it over soup, roasted squash, pasta or chicken.) Tj
T*
(Cost: about 30 cents. Impact: a restaurant.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Save your Parmesan rinds.) Tj
T*
(Don't throw away the hard cheese ends. Keep them in a bag in the freezer. Drop one into) Tj
T*
(any soup or sauce while it simmers \(try recipes 2, 3 or 6\), then fish it out before) Tj
T*
(serving. It melts into pure savory depth.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Roast a double batch of squash on Sunday.) Tj
T*
(Cube two squashes, roast at 425 F for 25 to 30 minutes, then cool. Half goes into the) Tj
T*
(week's soup or pasta, and the other half goes in the freezer in a flat bag. Future you) Tj
T*
(will send a thank-you note.) Tj
T*
() Tj
